{"sha": "a38a143321a5eb6dc0dbcdc6e0841c141d7220b459a09f58e003b097c7d75f48", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:7}", "将被积函数延拓为 $0$（即 $t = n$ 以外的部分）：$g_n(t) = (1 -", "\\frac tn)^n t^{x-1}\\mathbf{1}_{t \\leq n}$。逐点地，$g_n(t) \\to", "\\eu^{-t}t^{x-1}$（复利极限，见本科一年级分册）。", "控制：由 $\\ln(1 - u) \\leq -u$ 得 $(1 - \\frac tn)^n \\leq", "\\eu^{-t}$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{n}$ 上成立，于是 $\\abs{g_n(t)} \\leq", "\\eu^{-t}t^{x-1} = \\varphi(t)$，可积。控制收敛定理：", "\\[", "\\int_0^n \\Bigl(1 - \\frac tn\\Bigr)^n t^{x-1}\\dd t", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{} \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-t}t^{x-1}\\dd t", "= \\Gamma(x) .", "\\]", "（对左端反复分部积分，可得欧拉乘积", "形式 $\\Gamma(x) = \\lim \\frac{n!\\,n^x}{x(x+1)\\cdots(x+n)}$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:8}", "$H$ 关于 $x$ 可微（被积函数属于 $C^1$ 类，对 $x$ 而言，导数", "$-2x(1+t^2)\\cdot\\frac{\\eu^{-x^2(1+t^2)}}{1+t^2} =", "-2x\\,\\eu^{-x^2}\\eu^{-x^2t^2}$，在 $x$ 的紧集上连续且有界，", "对 $t \\in \\intcc{0}{1}$ 的控制显然成立）：", "\\[", "H'(x) = -2x\\,\\eu^{-x^2}\\int_0^1 \\eu^{-x^2t^2}\\,\\dd t", "\\overset{u = xt}{=} -2\\,\\eu^{-x^2}\\int_0^x \\eu^{-u^2}\\,\\dd u", "= -G'(x),", "\\]", "因为 $G'(x) = 2\\eu^{-x^2}\\int_0^x \\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t$（链式法则作用于平方项，", "并用微积分基本定理）。于是 $G + H$ 为", "常数，等于 $G(0) + H(0) = 0 + \\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd t}{1+t^2}", "= \\frac\\pi4$。", "", "当 $x \\to \\infty$ 时：$0 \\leq H(x) \\leq \\eu^{-x^2}\\int_0^1 \\dd t \\to", "0$，于是 $G(x) \\to \\frac\\pi4$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t = \\sqrt{\\frac\\pi4} =", "\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}{2} .", "\\]", "（由此可得 $\\Gamma\\bigl(\\frac12\\bigr) = 2\\int_0^\\infty", "\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t = \\sqrt\\pi$，作代换 $t = \\sqrt u$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:9}", "柯西--施瓦茨不等式（见本科一年级分册，在 $\\intcc{\\varepsilon}{M}$", "上成立并取极限）应用于分解式", "$t^{\\frac{x+y}{2}-1}\\eu^{-t} = \\bigl(t^{x-1}\\eu^{-t}\\bigr)^{1/2}", "\\bigl(t^{y-1}\\eu^{-t}\\bigr)^{1/2}$：", "\\[", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\Bigr) \\leq", "\\Gamma(x)^{1/2}\\,\\Gamma(y)^{1/2}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\ln\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\Bigr) \\leq \\frac{\\ln\\Gamma(x) +", "\\ln\\Gamma(y)}{2} :", "\\]", "$\\ln\\Gamma$ 是中点凸的；又因其连续", "（由\\cref{thm:b2:integration:gammaprops}），它是凸的", "（由\\cref{exo:b2:realfun:8}）。（对数凸性使 $\\Gamma$", "在阶乘的各种插值中唯一确定 --- 即", "Bohr--Mollerup 定理，本科三年级的一颗明珠。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:10}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 当 $x \\geq a > 0$ 时，被积函数关于 $x$ 的导数为", "        $-\\sin t\\,\\eu^{-xt}$，被 $\\eu^{-at}$ 控制：", "        由\\cref{thm:b2:integration:leibnizrule}可得 $F'(x) =", "        -\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\sin t\\,\\dd t$。两次分部积分", "        （或借助复指数）：", "        \\[", "        \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\sin t\\,\\dd t", "        = \\Im \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{(-x+\\iu)t}\\dd t", "        = \\Im\\frac{1}{x - \\iu} = \\frac{1}{1 + x^2} .", "        \\]", "  \\item $\\abs{F(x)} \\leq \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\dd t = \\frac1x \\to", "        0$。将 $F' = -\\frac{1}{1+x^2}$ 自 $x$ 积分", "        至 $\\infty$：$0 - F(x) = -\\bigl(\\frac\\pi2 - \\arctan x\\bigr)$，", "        于是 $F(x) = \\frac\\pi2 - \\arctan x$。", "  \\item 令 $x \\to 0^+$，利用在本阶段不加证明地承认的连续性：$F(0^+) =", "        \\frac\\pi2$，且 $F(0) = \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\dd", "        t$（半收敛的狄利克雷积分，", "        见\\cref{ex:b2:integration:sint}）：其值为", "        $\\frac\\pi2$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:11}", "收敛性：在 $0$ 附近，被积函数可连续延拓，延拓值为", "$1$（$\\sin t \\sim t$）；无穷远处被积函数 $\\leq t^{-2}$，", "绝对收敛。在 $\\intcc{\\varepsilon}{M}$ 上分部积分，", "取 $u = \\sin^2 t$，$v' = t^{-2}$：", "\\[", "\\int_\\varepsilon^M \\frac{\\sin^2 t}{t^2}\\dd t", "= \\Bigl[-\\frac{\\sin^2 t}{t}\\Bigr]_\\varepsilon^M", "+ \\int_\\varepsilon^M \\frac{2\\sin t\\cos t}{t}\\dd t", "= \\Bigl[-\\frac{\\sin^2 t}{t}\\Bigr]_\\varepsilon^M", "+ \\int_{2\\varepsilon}^{2M} \\frac{\\sin u}{u}\\dd u", "\\]", "（最后一个积分中 $u = 2t$）。方括号项在两端都", "趋于 $0$（$\\sin^2\\varepsilon/\\varepsilon \\leq \\varepsilon$；", "$\\sin^2 M/M \\leq 1/M$），最后一个积分趋于", "$\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\sin u}{u}\\dd u = \\frac\\pi2$", "（由\\cref{exo:b2:integration:10}）。于是", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty \\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\Bigr)^{\\!2}\\dd t", "= \\frac\\pi2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 分部积分，取 $u = \\frac{-1}{2t}$，$v' = -2t\\,\\eu^{-t^2}$", "        （从而 $v = \\eu^{-t^2}$）：", "        \\[", "        T(x) = \\Bigl[\\frac{-\\eu^{-t^2}}{2t}\\Bigr]_x^\\infty", "        - \\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{2t^2}\\dd t", "        = \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x}", "        - \\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{2t^2}\\dd t .", "        \\]", "        对新的积分用同样的手法（$u = \\frac{-1}{4t^3}$，", "        $v' = -2t\\,\\eu^{-t^2}$）：", "        \\[", "        \\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{2t^2}\\dd t", "        = \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{4x^3}", "        - \\frac34\\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{t^4}\\dd t ,", "        \\]", "        由此得到所预告的恒等式。", "  \\item 再分部积分一次，对余项作估计：", "        \\[", "        \\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{t^4}\\dd t", "        = \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x^5}", "        - \\frac52\\int_x^\\infty\\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{t^6}\\dd t", "        \\leq \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x^5},", "        \\]", "        于是 $0 \\leq \\frac34\\int_x^\\infty t^{-4}\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t", "        \\leq \\frac{3}{8x^5}\\eu^{-x^2}$。在第 1 问的恒等式中舍去（正的）", "        余项即得下界；舍去（负的）", "        第一次分部积分的第二项，", "        即得 $T(x) \\leq \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x}$。将", "        两侧不等式除以 $\\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x}$：比值", "        夹在 $1 - \\frac{1}{2x^2}$ 与 $1$ 之间，于是 $T(x)", "        \\sim \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x}$。", "  \\item 反复分部积分，得到形式级数", "        \\[", "        T(x) \\approx \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x}\\Bigl(1 -", "        \\frac{1}{2x^2} + \\frac{1\\cdot3}{(2x^2)^2} -", "        \\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdot5}{(2x^2)^3} + \\cdots\\Bigr),", "        \\]", "        其第 $k$ 个系数 $1\\cdot3\\cdots(2k-1) =", "        \\frac{(2k)!}{2^k k!}$ 增长得比任何等比", "        数列都快：对固定的 $x$，各项", "        $\\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdots(2k-1)}{(2x^2)^k}$ 趋于无穷大", "        （其比值为 $\\frac{2k+1}{2x^2} \\to \\infty$），因此", "        级数对每个 $x$ 都发散。它是一个", "        \\emph{渐近}展开式：在任一固定阶截断，", "        误差在 $x \\to \\infty$ 时与第一个被舍去的项同阶，", "        ——但它绝非收敛的", "        级数。（这一尾项估计即概率各章中的标准高斯", "        尾部界。）", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}